.TH NN-VALIDATE 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-validate \- validate a model against a dataset
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn validate [options] <model> <dataset>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Score predictions against expected tensors using the chosen metric.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-metric NAME
accuracy, mse, mae, or rmse.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 9 validation failure.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn validate model.onnx tests/
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-test(1), nn-regression(1)
